PN,36501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,FA wheelchair user is regularly forced
OL,7,Fto leave her own home just to get from
OL,8,Fher bedroom to her living room due to
OL,9,Fa shortage of properly accessible
OL,10,Fhomes.
OL,12,FDennis Queen, from Manchester, has
OL,13,Fbeen fighting for a suitable home for
OL,14,Fover two decades.
OL,16,FWhile her home is listed as
OL,17,F"accessible" - allowing her the space
OL,18,Fto move about her garden and her
OL,19,Fbathroom, she struggles to access any
OL,20,Fother rooms within her house due to
OL,21,Fsmall corridors and tight doorways.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,FInstead, the mum is often forced to
OL,7,Fspend the day in bed - unable to leave
OL,8,Fher own bedroom.
OL,10,F"I should be able to go to my kitchen
OL,11,Fand get a drink of water at the most
OL,12,Fbasic level," she said. "I feel like
OL,13,Fthat would be a fair thing to accept."
OL,15,FShe added: "I would also like to go
OL,16,Finto the living room when I'm well
OL,17,Fenough and sit with my children.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,F"If I want to go into my living room,
OL,7,FI need to go out of my bedroom, out of
OL,8,Fthe building, turn around on the ramp
OL,9,Fand then come back now that I'm at a
OL,10,Fnew angle to go into the living room.
OL,12,F"I don't use my living room,
OL,13,Fespecially in the winter, when I have
OL,14,Fto go outside in the rain to turn
OL,15,Faround to come back in."
OL,17,FDennis is not alone - there were
OL,18,Falmost 11,000 people in the North West
OL,19,Fwaiting for an accessible or adaptable
OL,20,Fhome from their council in 2025.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,FITV News sent freedom of information
OL,7,Frequests to every council in the North
OL,8,FWest, which revealed 2,208 wheelchair
OL,9,Fusers were waiting for a suitable home
OL,10,Fin our region.
OL,12,FAnd those are only the councils that
OL,13,Fstill have housing stock.
OL,15,FITV News found the local authorities
OL,16,Fwith the longest waitlists were Wigan,
OL,17,Fwith more than 1700 people waiting,
OL,18,Ffollowed by Cheshire East, which had
OL,19,F1400 people on their list.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,FThe fight for accessible housing has
OL,7,Fbeen going on for decades, and Dennis
OL,8,Fwas even interviewed at a protest back
OL,9,Fin January 2002.
OL,11,FShe said: "My daughter was five when
OL,12,Fwe did that protest, and she's almost
OL,13,F30 now.
OL,15,F"My children have never lived in a
OL,16,Fhome where mum can do everything and
OL,17,Fget around, and there's no need for it.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,F"It puts a much higher burden on
OL,7,Fsocial care, and it stops us having
OL,8,Ffamily life, which we're all entitled
OL,9,Fto."
OL,11,FShe added: "Back in the 90s, we used
OL,12,Fto be proud of Manchester because we
OL,13,Fwere at the forefront of making access
OL,14,Fhappen.
OL,16,F"We had buildings like the central
OL,17,Flibrary and the town hall that had all
OL,18,Fbeen made accessible. And now, we're
OL,19,Frunning behind everyone, and that's
OL,20,Fappalling."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,FHabinteg Housing Association say it is
OL,7,Fonly going to get worse.
OL,9,FChristina McGill, from Habinteg, said:
OL,10,F"Compared to the rest of the country,
OL,11,Fthere are far fewer homes that are
OL,12,Fgoing to be built that are suitable
OL,13,Ffor the needs of wheelchair users.
OL,15,F"Wheelchair users in the north west
OL,16,Fare worse off than anybody in any
OL,17,Fother region."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,FFelix Henson is a wheelchair user who
OL,7,Fhas been given access to a suitable
OL,8,Fhome. They said: "It's amazing how big
OL,9,Fof a difference it can make.
OL,11,F"I can get in and out of the house
OL,12,Fwhenever I want to, go to the toilet,
OL,13,Fthings you take for granted.
OL,15,F"The fact that I've got an accessible
OL,16,Fhouse and the fact that I've got a
OL,17,Fpower chair is what enabled me to do
OL,18,Fthings like get a degree."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,FThe government have set out a minimum
OL,7,Fcriteria for new build homes including
OL,8,Flevel access, wider doors and
OL,9,Fhallways, and an entrance level toilet.
OL,11,FDirectly addressing Dennis' situation
OL,12,Fa spokesperson at Manchester City
OL,13,FCouncil said: "The council's
OL,14,Fadaptations team, along with an
OL,15,Foccupational therapist, have visited
OL,16,Fthe property previously and approved
OL,17,Fan adaptation to the home that
OL,18,Fwould've significantly improved access
OL,19,Fto the kitchen.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,F"Unfortunately, this work was
OL,7,Fcancelled at the request of the
OL,8,Fresident. We would encourage them to
OL,9,Fget in touch, and we would be happy to
OL,10,Fvisit the home again and reassess what
OL,11,Fworks could be undertaken to help them
OL,12,Flive more independently."
OL,14,FA government spokesperson said:
OL,15,F"People who need accessible homes
OL,16,Fdeserve to get them as quickly as
OL,17,Fpossible, which is why we've consulted
OL,18,Fon new proposals that will require
OL,19,Flocal authorities to set clear
OL,20,Faccessibility standards for new homes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1786114088
OL,3,CWheelchair user unable to get into
OL,4,Cliving room of 'accessible home'
OL,6,F"This is alongside #723 million for
OL,7,Fthe Disabled Facilities Grant in 2026-
OL,8,F27, supporting tens of thousands of
OL,9,Fpeople with disabilities with home
OL,10,Fadaptations."
OL,12,FYou can see how many people are
OL,13,Fwaiting for an accessible or adaptable
OL,14,Fhome in your region below. Greyed-out
OL,15,Flocal authorities did not answer the
OL,16,Ffreedom of information request,
OL,17,Ftypically because they don't manage
OL,18,Fhousing.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
